-<main id="top"><section class="portfolio-hero" aria-labelledby="hero-heading"><div class="hero-scene" data-parallax-scene><div class="parallax-backdrop" data-depth="background" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/assets/hero-stage.webp" width="1672" height="941" alt=""></div><div class="hero-left"><div class="hero-greeting"><span>HELLO, I’M HADI.</span><p>CREATIVE DIRECTOR<br>& BRAND IDENTITY DESIGNER</p></div><div class="hero-message" data-depth="type"><h1 id="hero-heading"><span class="hero-word-one">BRAND</span><span class="hero-word-two">DESIGNER</span></h1></div><div class="hero-project-actions"><a href="mailto:hadi@intellignce.net?subject=Let%E2%80%99s%20discuss%20my%20project"><span>Discuss your project</span><span class="round-arrow">↗</span></a><a class="hero-work-link" href="#work">VIEW CASE STUDIES ↗</a></div></div><div class="parallax-subject" data-depth="subject"><img src="/assets/hero-subject-enhanced.png" width="1672" height="941" fetchpriority="high" decoding="sync" alt="Hadi Hassan, brand identity designer and creative director, speaking on stage"></div><div class="hero-summary"><span class="hero-note">A point of view.<br> A lasting impression.</span><p>I turn business ambition into distinctive brand identities, digital experiences and campaigns built to be understood, remembered and used.</p></div><div class="hero-location"><i aria-hidden="true"></i> LAHORE, PAKISTAN<br><span>WORKING WORLDWIDE</span></div></div></section><div class="bayfi-body"><section class="bf-reel" aria-labelledby="reel-heading"><h2 id="reel-heading" class="bf-sr-only">Creative showreel — Hadi Hassan</h2><div class="bf-reel-stage"><div class="bf-reel-word bf-reel-word-left" aria-hidden="true">Creative</div><button class="bf-reel-frame" aria-label="Enable showreel sound" aria-pressed="false"><video src="/assets/hadi-showreel.mp4" width="1920" height="1080" poster="/assets/hadi-showreel-poster.webp" autoplay muted playsinline loop preload="metadata" aria-hidden="true"></video><span class="bf-reel-cursor" aria-hidden="true">Sound on ↗</span></button><div class="bf-reel-word bf-reel-word-right" aria-hidden="true">Showreel</div><button class="bf-reel-pause" aria-label="Pause showreel">Pause</button></div></section><section class="v2sv-section" id="services" aria-labelledby="services-heading"><div class="v2sv-header"><h2 class="v2sv-heading" id="services-heading" data-bf-reveal>What I do.</h2><p class="v2-sub v2sv-sub">Strategy sets the direction.<br>Design turns it into something people can recognise and use.</p></div><div class="bf-service-item"><div class="v2sv-divider"></div><h3 class="bf-service-heading"><button class="v2sv-row" data-service-toggle aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="service-0"><img class="bf-service-icon" src="/assets/service1.webp" width="1024" height="1024" loading="lazy" alt=""><span class="v2sv-name">Branding Solutions</span><span class="v2sv-row-tags">Logo design · Brand guidelines</span><span class="bf-service-plus" aria-hidden="true">+</span></button></h3><figure class="bf-service-preview" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/assets/service-preview-1.jpg" width="2048" height="1143" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt=""></figure><div id="service-0" class="v2sv-expand-outer" inert aria-hidden="true"><div class="v2sv-expand-inner"><div class="v2sv-expand-content"><p>A logo is one part of a brand. I use research, positioning and visual design to build distinctive identity systems with the clarity, consistency and practical guidelines teams need to grow.</p><div class="bf-pills"><span>Logo Design</span><span>Product Design</span><span>Market Research</span></div><a class="bf-text-link" href="/?enquiry=1" data-lead-form data-lead-service="branding">Discuss this service ↗</a></div></div></div></div><div class="bf-service-item"><div class="v2sv-divider"></div><h3 class="bf-service-heading"><button class="v2sv-row" data-service-toggle aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="service-1"><img class="bf-service-icon" src="/assets/service2.webp" width="1024" height="1024" loading="lazy" alt=""><span class="v2sv-name">Design Solutions</span><span class="v2sv-row-tags">UI/UX · Graphic design</span><span class="bf-service-plus" aria-hidden="true">+</span></button></h3><figure class="bf-service-preview" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/assets/service-design-intellignce.webp" width="2048" height="1536" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt=""></figure><div id="service-1" class="v2sv-expand-outer" inert aria-hidden="true"><div class="v2sv-expand-inner"><div class="v2sv-expand-content"><p>I design websites, product interfaces and brand collateral as one connected experience, balancing visual character with clear hierarchy, responsive UX and practical usability.</p><div class="bf-pills"><span>UI/UX Design</span><span>Graphic Design</span><span>Collateral Design</span></div><a class="bf-text-link" href="/?enquiry=1" data-lead-form data-lead-service="design">Discuss this service ↗</a></div></div></div></div><div class="bf-service-item"><div class="v2sv-divider"></div><h3 class="bf-service-heading"><button class="v2sv-row" data-service-toggle aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="service-2"><img class="bf-service-icon" src="/assets/service3.webp" width="1024" height="1024" loading="lazy" alt=""><span class="v2sv-name">Social Media Creatives</span><span class="v2sv-row-tags">Content · Campaigns</span><span class="bf-service-plus" aria-hidden="true">+</span></button></h3><figure class="bf-service-preview" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/assets/service-preview-3.webp" width="808" height="632" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt=""></figure><div id="service-2" class="v2sv-expand-outer" inert aria-hidden="true"><div class="v2sv-expand-inner"><div class="v2sv-expand-content"><p>I develop social campaigns with a clear creative idea, then translate that direction into visual content, carousels, video and reels that work as a coherent brand system.</p><div class="bf-pills"><span>Visual Content</span><span>Video &amp; Reels</span><span>Content Strategy</span><span>Campaign Idea &amp; Execution</span></div><a class="bf-text-link" href="/?enquiry=1" data-lead-form data-lead-service="social">Discuss this service ↗</a></div></div></div></div><div class="bf-service-item"><div class="v2sv-divider"></div><h3 class="bf-service-heading"><button class="v2sv-row" data-service-toggle aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="service-3"><img class="bf-service-icon" src="/assets/service4.webp" width="1024" height="1024" loading="lazy" alt=""><span class="v2sv-name">E-commerce Solutions</span><span class="v2sv-row-tags">Stores · Product photography</span><span class="bf-service-plus" aria-hidden="true">+</span></button></h3><figure class="bf-service-preview" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/assets/service-preview-4.webp" width="808" height="632" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt=""></figure><div id="service-3" class="v2sv-expand-outer" inert aria-hidden="true"><div class="v2sv-expand-inner"><div class="v2sv-expand-content"><p>I shape e-commerce experiences around how customers evaluate products, combining store design, product photography and conversion-focused copy to make the next step clear.</p><div class="bf-pills"><span>Platform Setup</span><span>Product Photography</span><span>Copywriting</span></div><a class="bf-text-link" href="/?enquiry=1" data-lead-form data-lead-service="commerce">Discuss this service ↗</a></div></div></div></div><div class="bf-service-item"><div class="v2sv-divider"></div><h3 class="bf-service-heading"><button class="v2sv-row" data-service-toggle aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="service-4"><img class="bf-service-icon" src="/assets/service5.webp" width="1024" height="1024" loading="lazy" alt=""><span class="v2sv-name">App Development</span><span class="v2sv-row-tags">Web · SaaS · Mobile</span><span class="bf-service-plus" aria-hidden="true">+</span></button></h3><figure class="bf-service-preview" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/assets/service-app-omnihelp.jpg" width="1920" height="1