py"><span class="eyebrow">AI ANIMATION / CREATIVE EXPLORATION</span><h2 id="ai-project-title">A small mystery.<br>A bigger imagination.</h2><p>Character, atmosphere and visual storytelling. Explore an AI animation project through its story frames and production process.</p><a class="small-link" href="/ai-animation/">EXPLORE THE ANIMATION PROJECT ↗</a></div><a class="digital-collection-image" href="/ai-animation/" aria-label="Explore the AI animation case study"><img src="/assets/ai-animation-home-preview.png" width="600" height="329" style="max-width:600px;margin-inline:auto" loading="lazy" alt="Illustrated character reacting at a birthday party — AI animation by Hadi Hassan"><span>VISUAL DEVELOPMENT &amp; PRODUCTION PROCESS ↗</span></a></section><section class="digital-collection" aria-labelledby="digital-collection-title"><div class="digital-collection-copy"><span class="eyebrow">UI/UX · WEBSITES · SAAS</span><h2 id="digital-collection-title">Designed around<br>what people need.</h2><p>From service websites to healthcare platforms. Explore interface design that connects a clear story with a useful next step.</p><a class="small-link" href="/uiux-web-saas/">EXPLORE DIGITAL PROJECTS ↗</a></div><a class="digital-collection-image" href="/uiux-web-saas/" aria-label="Explore UI/UX, website and SaaS projects"><img src="/assets/digital-projects-consumer-connect.jpg" width="1920" height="1080" loading="lazy" alt="Consumer Connect application dashboard displayed on a tablet"><span>8 PROJECT CHAPTERS · 20 ORIGINAL SLIDES ↗</span></a></section><section class="hadi-folder" id="practice" aria-labelledby="practice-title"><div class="fld-inner"><div class="bf-practice-heading"><span class="bf-kicker">THE PRACTICE</span><h2 id="practice-title">Experience.<br>Put to work.</h2></div><div class="fld-stage"><div class="fld-back" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="fld-cards"><div class="fld-card" style="z-index:5"><div class="fld-card-inner"><span class="fld-label">SaaS applications</span><span class="fld-number" role="img" aria-label="18"><span data-total="18" data-suffix="" aria-hidden="true">18</span></span><span class="fld-sub">Web platforms and applications</span></div></div><div class="fld-card" style="z-index:4"><div class="fld-card-inner"><span class="fld-label">Website projects</span><span class="fld-number" role="img" aria-label="300+"><span data-total="300" data-suffix="+" aria-hidden="true">300+</span></span><span class="fld-sub">Designed and developed</span></div></div><div class="fld-card" style="z-index:3"><div class="fld-card-inner"><span class="fld-label">Branding & rebranding</span><span class="fld-number" role="img" aria-label="100+"><span data-total="100" data-suffix="+" aria-hidden="true">100+</span></span><span class="fld-sub">Businesses given a distinctive identity</span></div></div><div class="fld-card" style="z-index:2"><div class="fld-card-inner"><span class="fld-label">Happy customers</span><span class="fld-number" role="img" aria-label="80+"><span data-total="80" data-suffix="+" aria-hidden="true">80+</span></span><span class="fld-sub">Creative collaboration and delivery</span></div></div><div class="fld-card" style="z-index:1"><div class="fld-card-inner"><span class="fld-label">Students supported</span><span class="fld-number" role="img" aria-label="200+"><span data-total="200" data-suffix="+" aria-hidden="true">200+</span></span><span class="fld-sub">Taking the next step in their careers</span></div></div></div><div class="fld-flap"><div><span class="fld-flap-title">Impact</span><span class="fld-flap-sub">Experience, put into practice.</span></div><span class="bf-folder-mark" aria-hidden="true">H.</span></div></div></div></section><section class="creative-process" id="process" aria-labelledby="process-title"><header class="process-header"><div><span class="bf-kicker">THE WAY I WORK</span><h2 id="process-title">How I work.</h2><p>From the first conversation to the final handover.</p></div><span class="process-handnote" aria-hidden="true">Start with the right question.<svg viewBox="0 0 140 60" fill="none"><path d="M8 10c32 1 25 38 98 34m-14-14 18 15-21 7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span></header><div class="process-desk"><div class="process-paper" aria-hidden="true"></div><ol class="process-board"><li class="process-note process-discover"><span class="process-tape" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="process-index" aria-hidden="true">01 / WORKING NOTES</span><svg class="process-mark" viewBox="0 0 80 55" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M15 23c-2-18 32-23 34-3s-34 30-34 3Zm31 11 19 16" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg><h3>Discover</h3><p class="process-baseline">I understand the real business problem, audience, and opportunity.</p><details><summary>In practice<span aria-hidden="true"> +</span></summary><p>Before opening a design file, I ask what needs to change. I look at your audience, competitors and business goals, then agree on a brief that gives the work a purpose.</p></details></li><li class="process-note process-define"><span class="process-tape" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="process-index" aria-hidden="true">02 / WORKING NOTES</span><svg class="process-mark" viewBox="0 0 80 55" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 39 37 12 65 38M21 29h32M12 39h17m23 0h13" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg><h3>Define</h3><p class="process-baseline">I translate insights into strategy and creative direction.</p><details><summary>In practice<span aria-hidden="true"> +</span></summary><p>I explore the strongest ideas and show the thinking behind each route. I help you choose a direction for what it communicates, then define the visual principles that will guide the work.</p></details></li><li class="process-note process-create"><span class="process-tape" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="process-index" aria-hidden="true">03 / WORKING NOTES</span><svg class="process-mark" viewBox="0 0 80 55" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 40 47 8l13 13-35 29-13-10Zm35-32 13 13M14 42l-2 10 13-2m17-4c8-4 18-3 24 0" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg><h3>Create</h3><p class="process-baseline">I explore, design, prototype, and refine.</p><details><summary>In practice<span aria-hidden="true"> +</span></summary><p>This is where the idea has to hold up. I develop the identity or digital experience, refine it with your feedback and check the details in the situations where people will use it.</p></details></li><li class="process-note process-deliver"><span class="process-tape" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="process-index" aria-hidden="true">04 / WORKING NOTES</span><svg class="process-mark" viewBox="0 0 80 55" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 29c-4-28 53-31 57-4s-54 37-57 4Zm9-3 13 12L58 14" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg><h3>Deliver</h3><p class="process-baseline">I validate quality, prepare implementation, and support launch.</p><details><summary>In practice<span aria-hidden="true"> +</span></summary><p>The handover should make your next step easier. You receive organised files and guidance for using them, with launch or ongoing support agreed around what your team needs.</p></details></li></ol><p class="process-signoff">Clear thinking.<br><span>Considered work.</span></p></div></section><section class="v2cli-wrap bf-clients" id="clients" aria-labelledby="clients-heading"><div class="v2cli-inner"><div class="v2cli-header"><h2 class="v2cli-heading" id="clients-heading">Brands & projects.</h2><p class="v2cli-sub">The businesses and teams<br>behind the work.</p></div><ul class="bf-client-grid" aria-label="Client and project logos"><li class="bf-client-cell"><span class="bf-client-ink" style="--logo-width:98.85px;--logo-ratio:1368/350;--source-width:149.7076%;--source-left:-24.8538%;--source-top:-242.5714