/client-mark-14.webp" width="600" height="600" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="The Creative OAK"></span></li><li class="bf-client-cell"><span class="bf-client-ink" style="--logo-width:61.94px;--logo-ratio:356/232;--source-width:168.5393%;--source-left:-34.2697%;--source-top:-79.3103%"><img src="/assets/client-mark-15.webp" width="600" height="600" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="Liberty Land"></span></li><li class="bf-client-cell"><span class="bf-client-ink" style="--logo-width:48.00px;--logo-ratio:306/306;--source-width:196.0784%;--source-left:-48.0392%;--source-top:-48.0392%"><img src="/assets/client-mark-16.webp" width="600" height="600" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="Glacier Engineering"></span></li><li class="bf-client-cell"><span class="bf-client-ink" style="--logo-width:54.21px;--logo-ratio:362/308;--source-width:165.7459%;--source-left:-32.8729%;--source-top:-47.4026%"><img src="/assets/client-mark-17.webp" width="600" height="600" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="Salezpeak"></span></li><li class="bf-client-cell"><span class="bf-client-ink" style="--logo-width:73.24px;--logo-ratio:412/192;--source-width:145.6311%;--source-left:-25.9709%;--source-top:-110.4167%"><img src="/assets/client-mark-18.webp" width="600" height="600" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="Raz4"></span></li><li class="bf-client-cell"><span class="bf-client-ink" style="--logo-width:89.38px;--logo-ratio:441/138;--source-width:136.0544%;--source-left:-17.9138%;--source-top:-167.3913%"><img src="/assets/client-mark-19.webp" width="600" height="600" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="Glitch"></span></li><li class="bf-client-cell"><span class="bf-client-ink" style="--logo-width:41.93px;--logo-ratio:304/348;--source-width:197.3684%;--source-left:-48.6842%;--source-top:-36.2069%"><img src="/assets/client-mark-20.webp" width="600" height="600" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="Agility"></span></li></ul></div></section><section class="cinematic-story" id="story" aria-labelledby="story-heading"><div class="story-frame"><div class="story-photo"><img src="/assets/responsive/4c80d6a16f40-q90-1280.webp" width="2048" height="1143" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="Hadi Hassan speaking on stage with a microphone, viewed from the side" srcset="/assets/responsive/4c80d6a16f40-q90-160.webp 160w, /assets/responsive/4c80d6a16f40-q90-800.webp 800w, /assets/responsive/4c80d6a16f40-q90-1280.webp 1280w, /assets/hadi-founder-intro.jpg 2048w" sizes="(max-aspect-ratio: 16/9) 190vh, 100vw"></div><div class="story-shade" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="story-topline"><span>THE PERSON BEHIND THE PRACTICE</span><span>LAHORE · WORKING WORLDWIDE</span></div><div class="story-title"><span class="story-eyebrow">A LITTLE CONTEXT.</span><h2 id="story-heading" aria-label="A designer’s eye. A founder’s perspective."><span class="story-line" aria-hidden="true"><span>A designer’s</span></span><span class="story-line story-line-italic" aria-hidden="true"><span>eye.</span></span><span class="story-line" aria-hidden="true"><span>A founder’s</span></span><span class="story-line story-line-italic" aria-hidden="true"><span>perspective.</span></span></h2></div><div class="story-frame-footer"><div><span class="story-signature">Hadi Hassan</span><span class="story-role">CREATIVE DIRECTOR · FOUNDER, INTELLIGNCE</span></div><a href="/about/" class="story-read">About Hadi <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 4v16m-6-6 6 6 6-6"/></svg></a></div></div><div class="story-notes"><div class="story-notes-label"><span class="bf-kicker">CRAFT, WITH OWNERSHIP</span><span>From the idea<br>to the details.</span></div><div class="story-biography"><p>My career has grown from hands-on design into creative direction, brand building and digital product development. Through INTELLIGNCE, I bring strategic thinking and creative craft together with the responsibility to take an idea from concept to delivery.</p><p>I’m based in Lahore and work across brand systems, websites, product experiences, campaigns and visual storytelling. The brief shapes the work, whether that means a focused identity project, an MVP or an ongoing creative partnership.</p><a class="bf-button" href="/about/">Read my story</a></div></div></section><section class="hpr-wrap" id="engagements"><div class="hpr-inner"><div class="hpr-header"><h2 class="hpr-heading">A project.<br>Or a creative partner.</h2><p class="hpr-desc">A defined challenge or an ongoing seat at the table. We choose the working relationship around what you need to move forward.</p></div><div class="hpr-grid"><article class="hpr-card folder-card folder-card-1"><div class="folder-art"><img src="/assets/brand-system-20261016.webp" width="1080" height="1350" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="INTELLIGNCE brand mark on a clear plaque held against a red background"></div><div class="folder-front"><div class="folder-top"><span class="folder-number">01</span><a href="/?enquiry=1" data-lead-form aria-label="Discuss build a brand">↗</a></div><div class="folder-copy"><span class="bf-kicker">BRAND IDENTITY</span><h3>Build a brand.</h3><p>Launch with clarity or give an established business a more distinctive identity.</p><details class="folder-details"><summary>Scope &amp; deliverables <span>+</span></summary><ul><li>Creative direction</li><li>Logo & visual identity</li><li>Brand applications</li><li>Practical guidelines</li></ul><a class="folder-contact" href="/?enquiry=1" data-lead-form>Let’s discuss it ↗</a></details></div></div></article><article class="hpr-card folder-card folder-card-2"><div class="folder-art"><img src="/assets/creative-campaign-20261016.webp" width="1080" height="1350" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="INTELLIGNCE creative service artwork displayed in a warm contemporary interior"></div><div class="folder-front"><div class="folder-top"><span class="folder-number">02</span><a href="/?enquiry=1" data-lead-form aria-label="Discuss tell a story">↗</a></div><div class="folder-copy"><span class="bf-kicker">CREATIVE CAMPAIGN</span><h3>Tell a story.</h3><p>Connect your message, art direction and production through one memorable campaign idea.</p><details class="folder-details"><summary>Scope &amp; deliverables <span>+</span></summary><ul><li>Campaign concept</li><li>Art direction</li><li>Visual communication</li><li>Production assets</li></ul><a class="folder-contact" href="/?enquiry=1" data-lead-form>Let’s discuss it ↗</a></details></div></div></article><article class="hpr-card folder-card folder-card-3"><div class="folder-art"><img src="/assets/creative-partner-20261016.webp" width="1080" height="1350" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="Illuminated purple direction arrow against a vivid sky"></div><div class="folder-front"><div class="folder-top"><span class="folder-number">03</span><a href="/?enquiry=1" data-lead-form aria-label="Discuss keep creating">↗</a></div><div class="folder-copy"><span class="bf-kicker">COLLABORATION</span><h3>Keep creating.</h3><p>Bring experienced creative direction and hands-on design into your team’s working rhythm.</p><details class="folder-details"><summary>Scope &amp; deliverables <span>+</span></summary><ul><li>Agreed priorities</li><li>A clear working rhythm</li><li>Connected creative output</li><li>Project-based scope</li></ul><a class="folder-contact" href="/?enquiry=1" data-lead-form>Let’s discuss it ↗</a></details></div></div></article></div></div></section><section class="hfaq-wrap" id="questions"><div class="hfaq-inner"><div class="hfaq-left"><p class="hfaq-head-muted">Frequently</p><h2 class="hfaq-head">Asked questions.</h2><p class="hfaq-sub">A few things worth knowing before we start.</p><a class="bf-button transition-colors hover:bg-violet-500" href="https://wa.me/923084542868">Chat on WhatsApp ↗</a></div><div class="hfaq-accordion"><details><summary>What kinds of projects do you take on?<span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><p>Most projects begin with a launch, a rethink or a team that needs creative support. We can focus on one priority or connect several, such as an identity, a website and the campaign that introduces them.</p></details><details><summary>Can we work together remotely?<span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><p>Yes. I work remotely with founders and teams worldwide. We agree on milestones, review points and a communication rhythm that works across time zones.</p></details><details><summary>How is a project priced?<span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><p>Each proposal is based on the scope, deliverables, research and production involved. After discussing your goals and budget, I outline the work, milestones and fees before the project begins.</p></details><details><summary>Can you develop an existing brand?<span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><p>Yes. A rebrand can range from refining your logo and visual identity to building a broader brand system. We first identify what is working, what needs to change and where consistency is missing.</p></details><details><summary>What should I send to get started?<span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><p>Send a short introduction to your business, the challenge you want to solve, your current brand or website, and your timeline and budget. Email hadi@intellignce.net or use WhatsApp to start the conversation.</p></details></div></div></section></div></main>
