-define"><span class="process-tape" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="process-index" aria-hidden="true">02 / WORKING NOTES</span><svg class="process-mark" viewBox="0 0 80 55" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 39 37 12 65 38M21 29h32M12 39h17m23 0h13" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg><h3>Define</h3><p class="process-baseline">I translate insights into strategy and creative direction.</p><details><summary>In practice<span aria-hidden="true"> +</span></summary><p>I explore the strongest ideas and show the thinking behind each route. I help you choose a direction for what it communicates, then define the visual principles that will guide the work.</p></details></li><li class="process-note process-create"><span class="process-tape" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="process-index" aria-hidden="true">03 / WORKING NOTES</span><svg class="process-mark" viewBox="0 0 80 55" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 40 47 8l13 13-35 29-13-10Zm35-32 13 13M14 42l-2 10 13-2m17-4c8-4 18-3 24 0" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg><h3>Create</h3><p class="process-baseline">I explore, design, prototype, and refine.</p><details><summary>In practice<span aria-hidden="true"> +</span></summary><p>This is where the idea has to hold up. I develop the identity or digital experience, refine it with your feedback and check the details in the situations where people will use it.</p></details></li><li class="process-note process-deliver"><span class="process-tape" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="process-index" aria-hidden="true">04 / WORKING NOTES</span><svg class="process-mark" viewBox="0 0 80 55" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 29c-4-28 53-31 57-4s-54 37-57 4Zm9-3 13 12L58 14" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg><h3>Deliver</h3><p class="process-baseline">I validate quality, prepare implementation, and support launch.</p><details><summary>In prac